.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/843449430_974350555744068_5954102562197614430_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=MlyVJF14CisQ7kNvwH3H2k5&_nc_oc=Ado1z_3Kf0CRo-wtXBKdcWONYjj-uBYaG9xYbzHv8c9XNW5Skkj8NLYKJ_kDTAMg-IdV-ikhs3wBMcOZyAdJiZk6&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fgru6-1.fna&_nc_gid=zYAFGxOSyjCCd9elqeu0LQ&_nc_ss=7b289&oh=00_AQSXa44WOrYXhi6M2T5N6vSJFespPFdTYxcPFij-ti_N_A&oe=6B0082E6", "pageCategories": ["Health & wellness website"], "pageLikeCount": 262, "isActive": true, "startDate": "2026-10-12", "endDate": "2026-11-15", "platforms": ["FACEBOOK", "INSTAGRAM", "AUDIENCE_NETWORK", "WHATSAPP", "THREADS"], "bodyText": "I'm about to make every survival company on Facebook hate me.\n\nTwenty-two years in the Navy SEAL teams. We planned water before we planned ammo, every single time. You get three days without it, and most people don't have a plan for the tap being off one night.\n\nThis is what I keep for my own family:\n\n✅ 0.01 micron membrane, 20× finer than a standard hiking straw\n✅ Activated carbon stage for chemicals, sediment, taste and odour\n✅ 1,800 gallons from one straw. No cartridges, no refills\n✅ Backflushing syringe in the box, because every filter eventually clogs\n✅ No expiry date. Store it 10+ years and it's still ready\n✅ Screws onto any bottle\n\nOne for every person under your roof.\n\n👉 Tap Learn More and sort it before you need it.", "title": "Parents Check Your Emergency Filter [44894]", "ctaText": "Learn more", "ctaType": "LEARN_MORE", "linkUrl": "https://www.tryblackoutwater.com/pages/advertorial", "linkDomain": "tryblackoutwater.com", "linkCaption": "www.tryblackoutwater.com", "linkDescription": "0.01 micron. 1,800 gallons. No expiry.", "displayFormat": "VIDEO", "imageUrls": [], "videoUrls": ["https://video.fgru6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMvJkK-t6Plng9vqi8-H27NfV4rfoPXhnfeBe03HN2YdevcuTEl-vunZtQrd-3aeD5BmQ1i-2flZOdpE3F0AqPzHeMqkb5HHPIjjLlNsR3DQg.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Adr3ltcc3LE8hg28